---
source: crates/fauxfield/tests/cli.rs
expression: out
---
Print request logs from the running host

Usage: fauxfield logs [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --follow            Keep printing new requests until interrupted
  -q, --quiet             Suppress informational output
      --no-color          Disable coloured output (also honoured: the NO_COLOR environment variable)
      --server <SERVER>   Only these Servers (ID or name); repeatable
      --status <STATUS>   Status filter: `404` or a class like `5xx`
      --since <AGE>       Only requests newer than this, e.g. `30s`, `10m`, `2h`
      --har <FILE>        Write the matching requests as a HAR 1.2 file instead of printing them
  -w, --workspace <PATH>  Workspace folder (default: the nearest ancestor containing fauxfield.toml, else the current directory)
      --json              Machine-readable output with a stable schema
  -h, --help              Print help
